usage: module-nav explain [-h] [--help-root EXPLAIN_HELP_ROOT] [--no-content] [-n EXPLAIN_N]
                          concept

Cross-reference a concept across devguide/guides/bajadoc + code. See also: `rank` for a ranked
class lookup, `grep` for text in the sources.

positional arguments:
  concept               Concept to explain (e.g. 'SMA', 'skipModuleValidation')

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --help-root EXPLAIN_HELP_ROOT
                        Override niagara-help root (default: $NIAGARA_HOME/niagara-help)
  --no-content          Only do filename matching (skip content grep — faster)
  -n EXPLAIN_N          Max hits per doc tree (default 15)
